  "goodToKnow": "Das Biotop is a biotope or habitat, a place with a particular community of living things: ein Feuchtbiotop, ein geschütztes Biotop. Many German gardens have a small pond called a Gartenbiotop. Figuratively it means a closed scene or milieu: das Berliner Politik-Biotop. From Greek bios (life) and topos (place). Synonym: der Lebensraum. Plural: die Biotope."
